{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-026",
    "title": "誓言与背叛"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_145",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "盟主要求陆照临宣誓守住城门，随后却暗示只要交出残印便可放他离开。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "雪原的第三个清晨，陆照临开始发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4431,
          "end": 4431
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是伤口发炎，而是灵气从气海向四肢扩散，所过之处都留下灼烧般的痛感。他每走十步便要停下，掌心两枚残印隔着衣袋互相震动，像在催促他继续靠近第三盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4433,
          "end": 4433
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把一枚灰叶含在舌下：“你快到筑基门槛了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4435,
          "end": 4435
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还只是炼气三层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4437,
          "end": 4437
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“境界不是唯一的尺度。残印借给你的灵气，正在替你筑基。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4439,
          "end": 4439
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在前方回头：“那不是筑基，是借壳。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4441,
          "end": 4441
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有区别吗？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4443,
          "end": 4443
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“筑基之后，气海属于你。借壳之后，气海属于门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4445,
          "end": 4445
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的光在雪雾里闪烁。它距离他们越来越近，却始终不肯让人看清灯架的形状。每当陆照临试图以神识探查，便会忘记一件无关紧要的小事。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4447,
          "end": 4447
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "昨天他忘了顾长离常用哪只手握针。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4449,
          "end": 4449
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "今天他想不起无灯镇白发老妇的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4451,
          "end": 4451
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能再追了。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4453,
          "end": 4453
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋已经在路上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4455,
          "end": 4455
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她来不及。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4457,
          "end": 4457
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜停在一块黑色岩石旁。岩石上刻着一道新鲜剑痕，剑痕内嵌着玄霄宗的白玉粉末。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4459,
          "end": 4459
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“追兵在前面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4461,
          "end": 4461
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们绕过岩石，发现雪坡下立着一座临时营地。六名玄霄宗修士围着熄灭的火盆，灰袍修士坐在中央，手边放着一只黑色木盒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4463,
          "end": 4463
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "木盒与沈砚秋在登记堂拿出的那只相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4465,
          "end": 4465
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临。”灰袍修士抬头，“掌门愿意给你最后一次机会。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4467,
          "end": 4467
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把残印交还？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4469,
          "end": 4469
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“并接受问询。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4471,
          "end": 4471
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“问询之后删掉我的名字？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4473,
          "end": 4473
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士的眉头皱起：“你听了太多归墟盟的谎话。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4475,
          "end": 4475
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你告诉我，三年前冬至前七日，沈砚秋在雪原点过什么灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4477,
          "end": 4477
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "营地里所有人都沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4479,
          "end": 4479
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临知道自己问中了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4481,
          "end": 4481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士站起，剑锋指向他：“沈执事没有资格代表宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4483,
          "end": 4483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她有没有资格我不知道，但她有一份证词。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4485,
          "end": 4485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“证词可以伪造。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4487,
          "end": 4487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你们为什么派人追她？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4489,
          "end": 4489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士没有回答。他身后的弟子突然掐诀，雪地里升起数十根冰刺，封住三人的退路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4491,
          "end": 4491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔刀斩断最前方的冰刺，刀刃却被寒气冻住。顾长离甩出铜针，针尖穿过冰层，钉住一名弟子的脚踝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4493,
          "end": 4493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有出手。他的气海正在剧烈震动，青光从胸口直冲眉心，眼前浮出一片陌生的天空。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4495,
          "end": 4495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天空中没有云，只有一道横贯南北的裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4497,
          "end": 4497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "裂缝下方，三盏巨灯排列成三角。第一盏灯下站着玄霄宗的人，第二盏灯下站着顾氏的人，第三盏灯下站着一个没有脸的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4499,
          "end": 4499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无脸人抬起手，指向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4501,
          "end": 4501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“金丹之前，不可开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4503,
          "end": 4503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临在幻象中听见那句限制。他强行睁眼，冰刺已经逼近面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4505,
          "end": 4505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "掌心残印自行浮出，青光凝成一道薄盾。冰刺撞上薄盾，纷纷碎裂，碎冰落地后化成灰白粉末。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4507,
          "end": 4507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士脸色大变：“他已经能调用遗脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4509,
          "end": 4509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是调用。”叶观澜挡在陆照临前，“是它在借他的手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4511,
          "end": 4511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士挥剑攻来。陆照临抬臂格挡，剑锋与青光相撞，震得他手臂发麻。下一刻，他忽然想不起自己为何会握刀。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4513,
          "end": 4513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "短刀从指间滑落。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4515,
          "end": 4515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一把接住：“陆照临！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4517,
          "end": 4517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士抓住空隙，剑锋直刺他胸口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4521,
          "end": 4521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别再用残印！”顾长离喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4525,
          "end": 4525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向掌心残印：“那就把名字写在灯上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-087",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4785,
          "end": 4785
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离轻轻笑了一下：“灯会替你保管？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-088",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4787,
          "end": 4787
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4789,
          "end": 4789
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么写？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4791,
          "end": 4791
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少有人看见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4793,
          "end": 4793
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "身后的爆响再次传来，暗道顶部落下碎石。陆照临拉着顾长离加快脚步，脚下青光逐渐汇聚成完整的路纹，路纹尽头隐约出现一间石室。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4795,
          "end": 4795
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石室门上刻着一个陌生姓氏，笔画却与顾氏旧印相同。门缝中透出微弱火光，里面有人正在低声念诵一份名单。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4797,
          "end": 4797
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名单念到最后，声音忽然停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4799,
          "end": 4799
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4801,
          "end": 4801
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在门前，抬手握住了门环。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4803,
          "end": 4803
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内无人应答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4805,
          "end": 4805
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "誓言与背叛发生在同一张桌上。盟主要求陆照临宣誓守住城门，随后却暗示只要交出残印便可放他离开。陆照临把茶盏推回去，问盟约是否也能像茶水一样倒掉重沏。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4807,
          "end": 4807
        }
      }
    ],
